WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.392 --> 00:00:10.752
Wash and dry your hair the night before, then just come as is in the morning.

2
00:00:11.088 --> 00:00:16.080
It takes quite a while for hair to dry completely down to the scalp.

3
00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:24.576
If you wash it in the morning, the surface dries while the inside stays damp, which not only makes an iron feel too hot but also gets in the way of styling,

4
00:00:24.912 --> 00:00:32.976
and drying it fully takes time you can't afford to spend on the morning of your wedding.

5
00:00:33.312 --> 00:00:40.608
If your hair is naturally oily, you can wash it in the morning, but make sure to dry it completely down to the roots.

6
00:00:40.944 --> 00:00:48.096
The important thing is to skip conditioner, treatment, oil, or serum.

7
00:00:48.432 --> 00:00:58.080
If hair is too smooth, teasing for volume won't hold, and pins keep slipping out, which gets in the way of styling.

8
00:00:58.416 --> 00:01:06.456
Come in with hair that's shampooed only, squeaky clean, so we can create a firm, resilient, high-end wedding-parent style for you.
